y eventually exit out into a forest, then a city, and interact with the environments, exploring the world.", "summary": "Players decorate and spend time in a terrarium, and play match-3 puzzles to earn currency to use in the terrarium. This currency is used to buy toys, decorations, music, and floors.\n\nThe game features 3 game modes: Endless, with procedurally generated boards; Story, hand-crafted levels across 5 worlds; Terrarium, where players decorate and spend time with slimes.\n\nThe intent of the game is to be a second screen, fish tank kind of game, where it exists with the player as a companion, but not draw attention to itself.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/terralounge", "videos": [{"id": 199584, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "5Uad7WfsY3g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Uad7WfsY3g", "title": "TerraLounge Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5Uad7WfsY3g/fhddefault.jpg"}]}